@startuml SD-25-submit-job-rejection-request
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor black
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBorderColor black
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor white
skinparam EntityBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBorderColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam dpi 150
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 420
skinparam wrapWidth 420
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceActorFontSize 12
autonumber
title SD-25: Submit Job Rejection Request (UC-12)
' Traces: UC-12; FR-49, FR-56, FR-62, FR-63, FR-66; NFR-09
' Sources: DEC-42, DEC-43, DEC-52, DEC-53, DEC-56, DEC-58, DEC-59; sequence-diagram-review-round-2.md.
' Round-3 source: DEC-66, DEC-68; sequence-diagram-review-round-3.md.
actor Staff
boundary ":RequestPage" as Page
control ":RequestController" as RQ
entity ":Assignment" as ASG
entity ":JobRejectionRequest" as JRR
entity ":AuditLog" as AL

Staff -> Page : open(requestType, context)
activate Page
Page --> Staff : Published Assignments; request status
Staff -> Page : selectJob(assignment)
Page --> Staff : discuss with the Manager first
alt cancel at warning
  Page --> Staff : no request; Assignment unchanged
else proceed
  Staff -> Page : submitRejection(details)
  Page -> RQ ++ : submitRejection(staff, assignment, details)
  group atomic eligibility check and request save
    RQ -> ASG ++ : isEligible(staff)
    ASG --> RQ -- : eligible / ineligible
    RQ -> ASG ++ : hasPendingRejection()
    ASG --> RQ -- : existing Pending request?
    RQ -> RQ : hoursUntilStart(assignment)
    RQ -> RQ : classifyShortNotice(hours)
    RQ -> RQ : validateReasonAndExplanation(details)
    alt ineligible, existing Pending or required input missing
      RQ -> RQ : refuseSubmission()
    else valid at save time
      RQ -->> JRR ** : <<create>>(staff, assignment, details, shortNotice)
      RQ -> AL : record(Staff, Rejection submitted)
    end
  end
  alt save validation refused
    RQ --> Page : no request; eligibility or input error
  else save still fails after 3 retries
    RQ --> Page : Not saved; retry / contact IT Administrator
  else transaction committed
    RQ --> Page : Pending; Job stays Assigned
  end
  deactivate RQ
end
Page --> Staff : current outcome
deactivate Page
legend bottom
Staff opens the request page.
Eligibility includes own Van, Published week, Assigned status,
before Job start and no Pending request for that Assignment.
At most one Pending request per Assignment; history may contain
many decided requests (DEC-66). All Crew members share this limit.
Other Crew members see the existing Pending status.
The page may pre-validate; authoritative checks and creation are atomic.
Reasons: Personal emergency; Missing equipment or parts; Other
(comment required). Less than 48 h needs an explanation and sets
shortNotice; exactly 48 h is normal (DEC-52). Lapse is drawn in SD-22.
endlegend
@enduml
